# experiments/dcache -- track sources only; everything else in this directory is
# build output (the Makefile's binaries + *.o) or editor scratch.  Whitelist the
# source kinds so a newly-added binary never needs a matching ignore line.
*
# ...but not DIRECTORIES: `*` matches them too, git never descends into an
# excluded directory, and nothing below can re-include a file whose parent is
# excluded -- krwsem/'s tracked sources could not be staged by path, and a new
# source there would have been ignored silently.  Files inside a subdirectory
# still go through the whitelist below.
!*/
!*.c
!*.h
!*.md
!Makefile
!.gitignore
figures/*
!figures/.gitkeep
